th-academy-id "q-37972" :question/problem "What is the quotient of $3{x}^{3}-8$ divided by ${x}^{2}-1?$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n3{x}^{3}-8=3{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x-8\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x \\\\  & {x}^{2}-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x-8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-3x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $3x,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3x-8.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-37972/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "525be9c7-af11-506b-be69-444dfc640add"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-37972"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114492/selection/76273116de8e7ca02e41894674dda21b9f625934ebd69512d983445fad39e370" :answer/id #uuid "fe48562f-1da1-53c7-ad5d-f4b80e0baaaa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-12x-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114492/selection/053a67ad5d3568ab496356c16638307bbaab8f579f0731bd59533911eab24aac" :answer/id #uuid "cf4886af-f97a-5049-84c9-37eeae59bad4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10x-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114492/selection/1c77d2bd0336ec42354008b054111cbaa5510baae9d94df4fc3c5e1052e10e83" :answer/id #uuid "360d4066-e900-5647-acdd-b60e7b23c568" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6x+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114492/selection/34e545fc6cd7a7066b147624617be43eed29b30f32c3556519481fdb4e6809fb" :answer/id #uuid "fc56fbd3-6dff-527b-bfd7-cf26c61b6c27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10x+8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114492/selection/407aa33f8302883dd6358b1ff52834f4db6f7dd0e701918c2a0337c7ec280da8" :answer/id #uuid "35ae1c9f-351b-5677-9db0-427a7301954e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114492/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e7da6c48-1331-5c88-aa9c-b1f1b75b015a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114492/selection/76273116de8e7ca02e41894674dda21b9f625934ebd69512d983445fad39e370" :answer-field/choices ["q-114492/selection/76273116de8e7ca02e41894674dda21b9f625934ebd69512d983445fad39e370" "q-114492/selection/053a67ad5d3568ab496356c16638307bbaab8f579f0731bd59533911eab24aac" "q-114492/selection/1c77d2bd0336ec42354008b054111cbaa5510baae9d94df4fc3c5e1052e10e83" "q-114492/selection/34e545fc6cd7a7066b147624617be43eed29b30f32c3556519481fdb4e6809fb" "q-114492/selection/407aa33f8302883dd6358b1ff52834f4db6f7dd0e701918c2a0337c7ec280da8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114492" :question/id #uuid "f7696ef5-5d63-5be6-b1bf-664936ebd8be" :question/math-academy-id "q-114492" :question/problem "What is the remainder when  ${x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}-10x-7$ is divided by ${x}^{2}+2x+1?$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-4x+3 \\\\  & {x}^{2}+2x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}-10x-7\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{4}+2{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-4{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}-10x-7 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,4{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}-4x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{2}-6x-7 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{2}+6x+3}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,12x-10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}-4x+3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-12x-10.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-114492/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "76a7314b-4ebf-52eb-b464-97865ea9a81e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114492"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-322924/field-1/b087ba6ee068f5310bfc1ff5cf71f7e84d89e424ea6f51b6e4c6ea6a67415f76" :answer/id #uuid "0fa227dc-68a1-5f2c-a513-1ae35c1388ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2x^2+x-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-322924/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "96125f21-a19b-51f6-868c-e614a9df64ca" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-322924/field-1/b087ba6ee068f5310bfc1ff5cf71f7e84d89e424ea6f51b6e4c6ea6a67415f76" :answer-field/choices ["q-322924/field-1/b087ba6ee068f5310bfc1ff5cf71f7e84d89e424ea6f51b6e4c6ea6a67415f76"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-322924/field-2/5840169e06cd7d4d03897ce60efbb45a22cdc192bf0780744104c1baed24e90c" :answer/id #uuid "da3d15bb-67b6-5406-a377-9a5a9774edad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7x+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-322924/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "56eed73e-ff28-5c57-a694-c3748ebb6f4d" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-322924/field-2/5840169e06cd7d4d03897ce60efbb45a22cdc192bf0780744104c1baed24e90c" :answer-field/choices ["q-322924/field-2/5840169e06cd7d4d03897ce60efbb45a22cdc192bf0780744104c1baed24e90c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-322924" :question/id #uuid "9285cb79-17c7-50c5-8156-d768562b3668" :question/math-academy-id "q-322924" :question/problem "Express $\\frac{-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $4{x}^{2}-3x+2$ | __ |  |  | $4{x}^{2}-3x+2$ |" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}+x-5 \\\\  & 4{x}^{2}-3x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,8{x}^{4}+6{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-23{x}^{2}+24x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,20{x}^{2}+22x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,20{x}^{2}+15x-10}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $-2{x}^{2}+x-5,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $7x+6.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2} & =-2{x}^{2}+x-5+\\frac{7x+6}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-322924/field-1" "q-322924/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "76a7314b-4ebf-52eb-b464-97865ea9a81e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-322924"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-325106/field-1/eed0c120f18c57a32a553698a45469c8e7f1604d8fc1be62e28894a6f662b01b" :answer/id #uuid "02b57776-02ac-59e6-bbab-8d7bb5b4473b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325106/field-1/d37a7b27b1967da174649c9608e1dbad896e69dd12cb30d6238251d5dbc37873" :answer/id #uuid "82ce60c2-2106-5c9f-8f5c-a930eb40c785" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325106/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "6ff9760f-96e1-5baf-8aa1-c733cb08b5d9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-325106/field-1/eed0c120f18c57a32a553698a45469c8e7f1604d8fc1be62e28894a6f662b01b" :answer-field/choices ["q-325106/field-1/eed0c120f18c57a32a553698a45469c8e7f1604d8fc1be62e28894a6f662b01b" "q-325106/field-1/d37a7b27b1967da174649c9608e1dbad896e69dd12cb30d6238251d5dbc37873"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-325106" :question/id #uuid "12438b1b-50e6-5f18-b2e4-ecce962c3001" :question/math-academy-id "q-325106" :question/problem "What is the quotient of $-2{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-17{x}^{2}+3x+3$ divided by $-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-2x+1?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-3 \\\\  & -{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-2x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-2{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-17{x}^{2}+3x+3\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,2{x}^{4}+8{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{3}-13{x}^{2}+x+3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}+6x-3}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{2}-5x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $2x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-{x}^{2}-5x+6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-325106/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "76a7314b-4ebf-52eb-b464-97865ea9a81e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-325106"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-325143/field-1/d5447328bd214467436d353186b10034fb3389375d4ffd63c1eba08cfc366d8d" :answer/id #uuid "f20edbd6-fa52-5062-acfc-afcbe7a018aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+31" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325143/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8458d67b-1ddb-516b-b1c7-aca7b0e320a8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-325143/field-1/d5447328bd214467436d353186b10034fb3389375d4ffd63c1eba08cfc366d8d" :answer-field/choices ["q-325143/field-1/d5447328bd214467436d353186b10034fb3389375d4ffd63c1eba08cfc366d8d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-325143" :question/id #uuid "5f489c11-d556-5f9b-8cf2-027cb23be58e" :question/math-academy-id "q-325143" :question/problem "What is the remainder of $-4{x}^{3}+16$ divided by $2{x}^{2}-3x+5?$\n\nThe remainder is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n-4{x}^{3}+16=-4{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+16\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-3 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-3x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-4{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+6\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-10x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-6{x}^{2}+10x+16 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,6{x}^{2}+9x-15}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x+31\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $-2x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $x+31.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-325143/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "525be9c7-af11-506b-be69-444dfc640add"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-325143"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
